      "text": "So that's three Bacon Burgers and one Veggie Burger, no tomato. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "Actually make that two Bacon Burgers, not three. Sorry, my head is pounding. And I'll pay cash, can you make change for a 50?"
    },
    {
      "role": "business",
      "text": "No problem, two Bacon Burgers and one Veggie Burger, no tomato. We can do change for a 50. What's the delivery address?"
    },
    {
      "role": "customer",
      "text": "3974 Alder Blvd. Thanks."
    }
